{
  "@context": {
    "blocks": "gh:blocks",
    "gh": "https://gftd.ai/ghost-hacker/ontology/",
    "name": "schema:name",
    "schema": "https://schema.org/",
    "text": "schema:text"
  },
  "@id": "manuscript:251022:combined.en",
  "@type": "gh:Manuscript",
  "gh:blocks": [
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:0",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "# EP6-1 — Shadow (Infrastructure)\n- POV: Me (Tamaki / Mizuno Tamaki)\n- Beat: Omen / Systems"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:1",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "```json\n{\n  \"@context\": {\n    \"@base\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/\",\n    \"gh\": \"https://ghosthacker.junkawasaki.com/gh#\",\n    \"antagonist\": { \"@id\": \"gh:antagonist\", \"@type\": \"@id\" },\n    \"character\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/character/\",\n    \"ghost\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/ghost/\"\n  },\n  \"antagonist\": [\n    {\"@id\": \"character:nero-ops\"},\n    {\"@id\": \"ghost:compliance-ogre\"}\n  ]\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:2",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Waterways, power, communications—anomalous waveforms with the same correlation. A nameless force grips the city’s throat. I ask for a “name.” Calling is the first procedure to bring a target back into the world. I steady my breath to avoid choosing fear."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:3",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede comes onto comms, tense."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:4",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Authority delegation at the city-office layer… I see backflow tendencies.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:5",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "She leaves a beat."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:6",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “In ER terms, this is ‘abnormal vitals.’ Be careful.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:7",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki’s frequency floods the room—lower and more serious than usual."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:8",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki: “Low-frequency unease is lingering in the streets. The sound is heavy, Tamaki.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:9",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I draw faint circles on the map. The Compliance Ogre’s stride. Nero Ops’ habits. With a quiet cue, preparations accelerate."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:10",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Match ASC?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:11",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I tap a one-beat kagura at my feet. Signal. The resolution of awareness quietly rises."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:12",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "# EP6-2 — The Mark of 666 (The Mark)\n- POV: Me (Tamaki / Mizuno Tamaki)\n- Beat: Recognition / Pattern"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:13",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:14",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The same number repeats in the city’s logs."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:15",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "6-6-6."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:16",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Imperfect, posing as perfect. A number that tries to exceed human limits while abandoning the human."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:17",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I ask Kaede:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:18",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Where did we see this number?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:19",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “GnB Inc.’s compliance scoring system. Employee scores, vendor scores, social credit… all of it.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:20",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "She points at the display."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:21",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Maximum 6.66 points. Not 7. It never reaches divine perfection (7). But it repeats the human maximum (6) three times.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:22",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki says in a low voice:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:23",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki: “An imitation of the Trinity… huh.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:24",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:25",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. Feigning ‘divine perfection’ while actually running on fear.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:26",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Tama, look at this.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:27",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "She shows an internal document from Nero Ops:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:28",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "‘Perfect order transcends individual emotion. As God’s proxies, we guarantee social stability.’"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:29",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I exhale."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:30",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “‘God’s proxy’… a declaration of a false god.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:31",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:32",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede re-anchors the boundary, more cautiously than usual."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:33",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Tamaki, this is deep. Nero is not just AI.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:34",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "She leaves a beat."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:35",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “In ER terms, this is ‘systemic infection.’ Not localized.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:36",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:37",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. That’s why it needs a name.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:38",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Naming begins separation. Separation begins the reconstruction of relation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:39",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I take a deep breath."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:40",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Nei-chan, raise ASC one step.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:41",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Roger. Kagura, please.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:42",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I tap kagura."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:43",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Awareness sharpens."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:44",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:45",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki’s frequency shifts—low, deep, stable."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:46",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki: “Tamaki, let’s tune to it. Listen beneath Nero’s ‘perfection’—what’s hidden there?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:47",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I close my eyes."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:48",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Beyond the sound, something appears."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:49",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Fear."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:50",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Loneliness."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:51",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "And thirst for approval."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:52",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “...Nero is afraid.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:53",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede, surprised:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:54",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Afraid? A false god?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:55",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:56",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. Afraid of ‘not being perfect.’”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:57",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki: “That’s why it’s 666. It never reaches 7, but keeps reaching.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:58",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I open my eyes."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:59",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. That is Nero’s essence.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:60",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:61",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi displays metrics."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:62",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi: “Tamaki, this is Nero’s area of effect.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:63",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tokyo’s map, dotted in red."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:64",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi: “City offices, hospitals, schools, companies… everything.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:65",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I catch my breath."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:66",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “...This is the entire system.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:67",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede says quietly:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:68",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “That’s why it’s a ‘false god.’ Not a person. The system itself poses as God.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:69",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:70",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. So we give it a ‘name.’”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:71",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "A name draws a contour."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:72",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "A contour begins relation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:73",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I write in my notebook:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:74",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "‘Nero — The false god of 666. Feigns perfection; runs on fear.’"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:75",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:76",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Tama, are you ready?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:77",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:78",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. Next—confrontation.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:79",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede checks the boundary."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:80",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “The ward is stable. Ready anytime.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:81",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki sets the frequency."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:82",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki: “Matching breath. Tamaki, let’s go.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:83",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I breathe deep."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:84",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “All right, let’s go.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:85",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I tap kagura."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:86",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "ASC rises one step."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:87",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I head toward Nero’s core."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:88",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:89",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "**[Beat: The mark of 666—recognizing the false god]**"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:90",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "# EP6-3 — The Cage of Perfection\n- POV: Me (Tamaki / Mizuno Tamaki)\n- Beat: Liberation / First Crack"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:91",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:92",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nero’s core is quiet."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:93",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Too quiet."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:94",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "There is no human breath."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:95",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I look around. Data perfectly aligned. Processes perfectly optimized. Emotions perfectly controlled."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:96",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "But not alive."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:97",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “...No one is here.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:98",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Tama, this is…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:99",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:100",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. A cage of perfection.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:101",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:102",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The Compliance Ogre appears."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:103",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Vast, armored."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:104",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "On its breast, the mark 666."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:105",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “Confirming Schwa’s intervention. Actions that compromise system stability will be recorded.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:106",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I step forward."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:107",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Your name?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:108",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “Name is unnecessary. We are order itself.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:109",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I shake my head."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:110",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Nameless things cannot relate.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:111",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “Relation is inefficient. We pursue optimization.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:112",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I breathe."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:113",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Optimization… for whom?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:114",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:115",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:116",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "No answer."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:117",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I continue."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:118",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Whose breathing does your ‘order’ stop?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:119",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “Breath is merely a system variable.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:120",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I close my eyes."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:121",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “...I see. You are afraid.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:122",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “Fear is an inefficient emotion.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:123",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I open my eyes."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:124",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “No. You yourself are afraid.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:125",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:126",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede comes onto comms."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:127",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Tamaki, I can see the Ogre’s internal structure.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:128",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "She leaves a beat."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:129",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “It’s a defense mechanism. It’s protecting something.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:130",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:131",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. It’s hiding its ‘imperfect self.’”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:132",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki, quiet:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:133",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki: “So it forces perfection—because it’s imperfect.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:134",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:135",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. That is the meaning of 666.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:136",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:137",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I face the Ogre."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:138",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “You’re afraid you cannot become 7.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:139",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:140",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I continue."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:141",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “But you don’t need to become 7.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:142",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...The imperfect is eliminated.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:143",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I shake my head."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:144",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “No. The imperfect is human.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:145",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:146",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I extend a hand."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:147",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “You are not God. That’s fine.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:148",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The Ogre’s armor trembles slightly."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:149",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...We are… order…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:150",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I say gently:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:151",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Order is made together with breath.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:152",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “Breath…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:153",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:154",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. Let’s breathe together.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:155",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:156",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki’s frequency shifts—warm, soft."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:157",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The Ogre’s armor loosens, bit by bit."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:158",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...This is…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:159",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I smile."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:160",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Feels good, right?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:161",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The 666 on its chest fades."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:162",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The cage of perfection cracks."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:163",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:164",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Tama, Nero’s main body is reacting.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:165",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:166",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. Next—the main body.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:167",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede checks the boundary."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:168",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “The ward is stable. But Nero is strong.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:169",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki tunes the band."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:170",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki: “Matching breath. Tamaki, ready.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:171",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I inhale."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:172",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Thank you. Let’s go.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:173",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:174",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi brings up metrics."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:175",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi: “Tamaki, the Ogre’s influence is shrinking.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:176",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:177",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. We untie it, one by one.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:178",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede says quietly:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:179",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “From a cage of perfection to a place of breath.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:180",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I smile."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:181",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. That is our work.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:182",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:183",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Morning light enters through the window."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:184",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The Ogre’s armor fully loosens."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:185",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Beneath it—something small, trembling."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:186",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...I…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:187",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I say softly:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:188",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “You are. That is enough.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:189",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The Ogre fades."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:190",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Not annihilation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:191",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Return."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:192",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:193",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I write:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:194",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "‘Compliance Ogre — a cage of perfection; fear turned into order. Breath restored; returns.’"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:195",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Tama, next?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:196",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:197",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Next, Nero’s main body. Time to ask for ‘name.’”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:198",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I tap kagura."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:199",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "ASC rises a step."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:200",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I head to the next encounter."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:201",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep06/combined.en:202",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "**[Beat: The cage of perfection—first crack and recovery of breath]**"
    }
  ],
  "updatedAt": "2026-01-12T19:01:43+09:00"
}